              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INobi, umuzi wabapristi, walichitha ngosiko lwenkemba, abesilisa nabesifazane, nabantwana, nezinsana, nezinkomo, nezimbongolo, nezimvu, ngosiko lwenkemba.",
