              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaphunyuka enye yamadodana ka-Ahimeleki indodana ka-Ahithubi ogama layo lingu-Abiyathara, yabaleka emva kukaDavide.",
          "type": "text",
