        },
        {
          "text": "UDavide wayesethi ku-Abiyathara: “Ngangazi ngalolo suku lapho uDowegi wakwa-Edomi elapho, ukuthi wayeyakusho nokusho kuSawule ukuthi: “Ngabulala bonke abantu bendlu kayihlo.",
